{"id":"5366527ad0dc16ba","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-no-oracle-splitting.md","title":"无分裂时的全输出可计算","display":"lem-no-oracle-splitting — 无分裂时的全输出可计算","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting","aliases":["20-lem-no-oracle-splitting"],"display":"lem-no-oracle-splitting — 无分裂时的全输出可计算","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.2.6 证明中 (6.10) 失败的分支","source_printed_pages":[136],"source_pdf_pages":[170],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-no-oracle-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-no-oracle-splitting — 无分裂时的全输出可计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.2.6 证明中 (6.10) 失败的分支"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>170</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(X\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\Phi_e^X\">\\(f=\\Phi_e^X\\)</span> 是全函数。假设不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(\\rho,\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}no\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}no\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把有限常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,\\sigma\">\\(e,\\sigma\\)</span> 编入普通程序。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，交错搜索全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span> 的有限停止计算，遇到第一个输出便返回。因为真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的计算停止，其有限 use 给出某个这样的见证；无分裂假设保证任何见证均与真实输出相同。这一算法不需识别搜索所得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是否是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的前缀，也不需判断否定的无分裂条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.2.6 证明中 (6.10) 失败的分支；印刷页 136；PDF 第 170 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\Phi_e^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\tau\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}no\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.","display":true},{"tex":"e,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b8910885bfb6ce8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","140cce30ee9c16d1","e343870c773cb68e"]}